<title>USA: Pass Christian, Miss., to vote on $10.1 mln GOs.</title>
<headline>Pass Christian, Miss., to vote on $10.1 mln GOs.</headline>
<dateline>PASS CHRISTIAN, Miss. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>School officials in Pass Christian, Miss., set a May 6 referendum on a $10.1 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>Proceeds would fund construction of a new high school and additions and improvements at three other schools.School district enrollment has risen to 1,764 this year from 1,406 in 1990.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
</text>
